            "id": 53007,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizzerà questo frammento di codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo entrambe le chiamate a <code>pop()</code>, quali nomi rimangono e quale lunghezza viene visualizzata?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Rimangono Frank e Monica e viene visualizzato <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimangono Frank, Monica e Fiona e viene visualizzato <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rimangono tutti e quattro i nomi e viene visualizzato <code>4</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Rimangono Fiona e Lip e viene visualizzato <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Rimangono Frank e Monica e viene visualizzato <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
